{"parse": {"title": "Haunted Star", "pageid": 1566, "revid": 6818, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  \" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 85px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/5/59/Haunted_Star.png/revision/latest?cb=20221029052618\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Haunted Star\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/5/59/Haunted_Star.png/revision/latest?cb=20221029052618\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Haunted Star.png\" data-image-key=\"Haunted_Star.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The <b>Haunted Star</b> is a new obtainable item introduced in the <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log#Update_Halloween_-_Halloween_2022_Update\" title=\"Update Log\">HALLOWEEN</a> update which can be purchased for <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Candies\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/df/Candies.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20221029003129\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Candies.png\" data-image-key=\"Candies.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Candies) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">150 Candies<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">150 Candies</span></span></a> from the Navi NPC next to spawn!\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Information\">Information</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Inside the <b>Haunted Star</b>, you can discover 3 new exclusive units and 13 different Halloween themed skins!</li>\n<li>If you haven't received a <span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Mythical) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">Mythical<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">Mythical</span></span> after 400 <b>Haunted Stars</b>, you will get one guaranteed!</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Star_Chances\">Star Chances</span></h2>\n<div style=\"font-family: &#39;Fredoka One&#39;,rubik,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;\">\n<ul><li><span style=\"color: #0d8cff;\">Rare Skin: 81.5%</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #7c04f5;\">Epic Skin: 16.0%</span></li>\n<li>⭐<span style=\"color: #ffc71e;\">Legendary Skin: 2.0%</span></li>\n<li>🎃<span style=\"position: relative; background: linear-gradient(0, #76f1ff 30%, #fe56ff 50%, #ffec62 60%, #fe56ff 77%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Mythic Skin: 0.25%<span class=\"Tsh(Game) mobile-hidden\" style=\"position: absolute; z-index: -1; left: 0;\">Mythical</span></span></li>\n<li>👻<span style=\"color: #e01419;\">Mythic Unit: 0.25%</span></li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtainable_Units\">Obtainable Units</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"container&#95;ChBox\" style=\"border-radius: 8px; background: #2e2e2e29; box-shadow: 0 0 11px -2px #94949480, inset 0 0 20px 0px #96969633;display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill,minmax(115px,1fr)); grid-auto-flow: row; justify-items: center; list-style-type: none; grid-row-gap: 13px; font-size: 18px;border-radius: 8px; background: #2e2e2e29; box-shadow: 0 0 11px -2px #94949480, inset 0 0 20px 0px #96969633; margin: 0; padding: 13px; overflow: hidden;\">\n<dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Unknown)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Moriu.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Moriu.png\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"101\">File:Moriu.png</span></a></span></div></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text\">Moriu</div></dd>\n<dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Unknown)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Peruna.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Peruna.png\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"101\">File:Peruna.png</span></a></span></div></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text\">Peruna</div></dd>\n<dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Unknown)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Broke.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Broke.png\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"101\">File:Broke.png</span></a></span></div></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text\">Broke</div></dd>\n</ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtainable_Skins\">Obtainable Skins</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Skins_obtainable_from_the_Haunted_Star_capsule\"><center>Skins obtainable from the Haunted Star capsule</center></span></h3>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\" align=\"center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Image\n</th>\n<th>Unit\n</th>\n<th>Skin\n</th></tr><tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/0/03/Dezu_%28Trick_or_Treat%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20221030053953\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Dezu (Trick or Treat)\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/0/03/Dezu_%28Trick_or_Treat%29.png/rev